==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite easy with the right cats. Have a Research Combo and both [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]]. Attempt to get out as many [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titans]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]], and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] to deal with the Otter. [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], [[Ring Girl Cat]], or any decent anti-Dark cat can help with the Dark enemies.

